# Prettier is NOT this repo's formatter, and this file plus .prettierrc exist to make an
# accidental run harmless rather than to invite one.
#
# Measured 2026-08-26: `prettier --write` over web/ reflows 113 of 301 files at printWidth
# 100 and more at every other width, because the tree was hand-written and never
# prettier-formatted. .prettierrc pins the two settings whose defaults actually caused
# damage — prettier's double quotes and semicolons landed silently in
# packages/i18n/{he,en,ru}/people.ts during W2 and went unnoticed for a wave. eslint's
# `quotes` and `semi` rules are the enforcement; this is the guard rail.
#
# Generated output is never formatted by hand or by tool.
openapi.json
web/packages/api-client/src/schema.d.ts
**/*.gen.ts
**/dist/**
**/dev-dist/**
**/node_modules/**

# The canvas exports are a visual reference, not source (D10's corollary).
docs/design/canvas/**
